{"compatibility":"minor","safety_note_md":"# SafeStan Safety Note

Compatibility: minor.

Protected data: `chosen_action`.

Generated files: `model_safe.stan`, `data_safe.json`.

Changes: reordered the model block so that the parameter `beta` is sampled from its prior before any use. The original local `logits` computation used `beta` before its prior; the safe version inlines the same expression in the `categorical_logit` likelihood after `beta ~ lognormal(0, 0.75)`. The data are unchanged.
","model_safe_stan":"// ForestDB translation: Schelling Coordination Game
data {
  int<lower=1> A;
  int<lower=1> N;
  array[N] int<lower=1, upper=A> chosen_action;
  vector[A] utility;
}
parameters {
  real<lower=0> beta;
}
model {
  beta ~ lognormal(0, 0.75);
  chosen_action ~ categorical_logit(beta * utility);
}
generated quantities {
  simplex[A] action_prob = softmax(beta * utility);
}
","data_safe_json":"{"A":1,"N":2,"chosen_action":[1,1],"utility":[5.6842159911613015]}","protected_variables":["chosen_action"]}
